.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PKCS7_GET_OCTET_STRING 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm PKCS7_get_octet_string
.Nd return octet string from a PKCS#7 envelopedData structure
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/pkcs7.h
.Ft ASN1_OCTET_STRING *
.Fo PKCS7_get_octet_string
.Fa "PKCS7 *p7"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn PKCS7_get_octet_string
returns a pointer to an ASN1 octet string from a PKCS#7 envelopedData
structure or
.Dv NULL
if the structure cannot be parsed.
.Sh NOTES
As the
.Sy 0
implies,
.Fn PKCS7_get_octet_string
returns internal pointers which should not be freed by the caller.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn PKCS7_get_octet_string
returns an ASN1_OCTET_STRING pointer.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr PKCS7_type_is_data 3
